    "instruction": "Create a mega-dropdown navigation menu that expands on hover with multi-column links.",
    "output": "<style>\n  .nav-outer { position: relative; display: inline-block; }\n  .nav-trigger { padding: .7rem 1.25rem; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }\n  .mega {\n    visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 8px); left: 0;\n    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 200px); gap: 1.5rem; padding: 1.5rem;\n    background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px;\n    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(15,23,42,.1); transition: opacity .15s;\n  }\n  .nav-outer:hover .mega, .nav-outer:focus-within .mega { visibility: visible; opacity: 1; }\n  .mega h4 { margin: 0 0 .6rem; font-size: .8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; color: #64748b; }\n  .mega a { display: block; color: #334155; text-decoration: none; padding: .3rem 0; font-size: .9rem; }\n  .mega a:hover { color: #2563eb; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"nav-outer\">\n  <button class=\"nav-trigger\">Products &#9662;</button>\n  <div class=\"mega\">\n    <div><h4>Build</h4><a href=\"#\">Editor</a><a href=\"#\">CLI</a></div>\n    <div><h4>Deploy</h4><a href=\"#\">Hosting</a><a href=\"#\">CDN</a></div>\n    <div><h4>Monitor</h4><a href=\"#\">Analytics</a><a href=\"#\">Alerts</a></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
